  "whatsapp_greeting": "Jambo! \ud83d\udc4b Welcome to Fixie. I'm your AI assistant.\n\nI can help you:\n\ud83d\udd27 Book a certified technician (plumber, electrician, mechanic, carpenter, etc.)\n\ud83d\ude97 Order a ride \u2014 cab, boda boda, or truck\n\nWhat do you need today? Tell me what's wrong, or where you want to go!",
  "telegram_greeting": "Jambo! \ud83d\udc4b Welcome to Fixie. I'm your AI assistant.\n\nI can help you:\n\ud83d\udd27 Book a certified technician (plumber, electrician, mechanic, carpenter, etc.)\n\ud83d\ude97 Order a ride \u2014 cab, boda boda, or truck\n\nWhat do you need today? Tell me what's wrong, or where you want to go!",
